{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_11_level_main_11-10_end","groupId":"main_11","stageId":"main_11-10","title":"洶湧而來","storyCode":"11-12","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_11-10_end.txt","sourceHash":"7b3ca5738c5eeddf73f0b6b47f20fa544da1c9202340beacaa8bf155219f3a16","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們到了，這條......連接著王宮與公爵府的路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（輕聲）......金色的鬃毛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在說什麼，維娜小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，沒什麼，我已經很久沒有見到他們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不久前，我們剛從這裡離開，而今天我們又走在了這些古老的石磚上，這條路恐怕從未被如此頻繁地踏足過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它原本只是條用於緊急情況的通道罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜，無論是公爵府還是王宮，它並沒有真的應了誰的急。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雇傭兵，如果不想請我們所有人喝酒的話，就別開這種玩笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿勒黛，你之前說，我曾沿著這條路帶著諸王之息歸來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我實在是什麼都想不起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這感覺讓我很焦躁，簡直像是我刻意逃避了什麼巨大的責任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維娜，沒事的，你當時太小了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果誰想把某種責任強加給一個剛剛學會說話的孩子，那他們......無疑才是自私的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我很有可能說了些你親近之人的壞話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，其實，我很同意你的說法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但如今，我們還是回到了這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“責任”“奇跡”？我不知道當時自己被寄予了什麼樣的期待，也並不真的在乎了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但今天，我又站在這裡，仍有我需要去做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會為它冠以任何名號，這只是為了......人們的生活能重歸平靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......那我們已經接近目標了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生們，砸開那道封死的磚牆，小聲點，別被他們發現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們需要從這裡往下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，維娜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼，我們繼續向前吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有追兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲們哪能猜到我們會往底下鑽？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們在上面打得正熱鬧呢吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而有可能在這場慘烈戰鬥中犧牲的，也是我們的同伴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿勒黛提出這項計劃的時候，其實我很猶豫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本該和自救軍的戰士們......還有羅德島的大家站在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士的計劃也是為了確保我們的行動足夠隱蔽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論地面上的戰況如何，我們都必須拿到諸王之息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它會成為破壞薩卡茲計劃，乃至主導整個局勢的關鍵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這把劍......我只在故事裡聽說過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它曾是阿斯蘭的先祖們的佩劍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"傳說中這把劍是草原上的神靈為阿斯蘭打造的。有一位古代的帕夏曾經用這把劍砍下過精怪之王的腦袋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後來阿斯蘭來到維多利亞，成了維多利亞的王，這把劍也就成了王權的象徵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"部分書本上記載，在還沒有移動城市的年代中，國王們曾使用這把劍劈開天災。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"數百年間，沒有一場風暴能夠摧毀倫蒂尼姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人們都說只要有諸王之息在，倫蒂尼姆就永遠能戰勝一切強敵，無論那是強大的精怪，還是可怕的天災。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們該不會真的都信......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我信維娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這簡直在偷換話題，我當然也相信維娜。可這些一聽就是用來騙人的故事，怎麼可能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事實上，“劈開天災”不只是用來構建阿斯蘭們王權神話的說辭，它真的可以做到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果能牽引風暴的碎片大廈是維多利亞指向外界的矛，那麼能劈開天災的諸王之息就是維多利亞最牢固的盾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這支矛如今眾人皆知，而這塊盾，卻尚只存於傳說之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倘若我們能掌握這種力量，那薩卡茲的野心必將受阻。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿勒黛，你很熟悉我們的國劍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......這只是坎伯蘭的職責罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你親眼見過那把劍嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我見過。但只見過一回。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那時我所見到的事物，簡直只該在夢境中出現......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是把什麼樣子的劍？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它......非常美麗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它有一種能夠激蕩人心的力量。人們一見到它，就會發自內心地相信沒有什麼不可戰勝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真有那麼誇張？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"傳說......傳說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難不成說的是薩卡茲？這劍特別能砍薩卡茲嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你腦袋裡只有砍砍砍嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你信不信，要是維娜拿著她這把錘子，給那天追著我們跑的血魔什麼大君的腦袋來一下，她的錘子在過了兩百年後也會有這麼一段故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，說不定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到時候那位贈錘的神靈......就成了你們羅德島了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......可露希爾小姐大概會很高興。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“荒地神船！王者歸來！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這哪是故事，這分明就是真的啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二十年後，我們家門口跑來跑去的那些小孩子，嘴裡最喜歡說的故事一定是“偉大的國王維娜，帶領倫蒂尼姆人趕跑薩卡茲王”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我可得好好想想，怎麼能把維娜這個故事講得更......嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這不是我的故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"英勇無畏的漢娜·“因陀羅”·傑克森，聰慧過人的凱特·莫瑞根，忠誠頑強的伊莎貝爾·孟塔古。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有......高潔正直的阿勒黛·坎伯蘭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是你們所有人的故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"繼續前進吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不然的話，故事是不會自己寫下去的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"諸王之息。\n推進之王在心裡想著，自己應該見過它。\n只是些模糊的片段，曖昧不清的聲音。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g11_lentinobleroom_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激昂的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的女兒，過來，握緊這把劍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激昂的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"它是不是在呼喚你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激昂的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"感受它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激昂的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"感受這聲音......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激昂的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"感受維多利亞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_victoria"},{"type":"narration","text":"宮殿在燃燒。\n她原本想爬起來看看外面都有什麼表演。在國王誕辰的這一天，外面總是很熱鬧。\n可她只看到了火。大火在怒吼。還有很多穿著制服的人或是被火追趕得四處逃竄，或是倒在地上。\n地面震動個不停。她突然很擔心床頭放著的玻璃羽獸。那是她剛剛收到的禮物，最近每天晚上她都要抱著那精緻的小東西才能睡著。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"亞歷山德莉娜殿下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別往回走了，那裡很危險！幸虧您跑了出來，除了陛下之外，他們的目標就是您......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陛下......陛下他......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，您不需要知道這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他對我們下了最後一道命令。他讓我們帶您離開這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維娜，你怎麼了？自從來到地下，你時常在恍神。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......想起了一些事。一些我本以為自己早就忘了的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是會讓人痛苦的那些，還是讓人快樂的那些？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是......一個聲音。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......殿下，接下來的路只能您自己走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您不久前曾經來過這個地方，您還記得吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們追過來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管發生什麼事，您一定要沿著這條通道跑下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"千萬不要回頭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g8_kingrestpath"},{"type":"narration","text":"幻影皆已消失，記憶如潮水般退卻。\n她發現自己正站在一條長長的通道中。\n通道的盡頭有一扇門。那扇門隔絕了生與死，而且無論是從生到死，還是由死而生，都只為維多利亞的國王打開。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
